  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nWhen you die, you appear in a cinema with a number of other people who look like you. You find out that they are your previous reincarnations, and soon you all begin watching your next life on the big screen. What kind of person will you be? You all watch as the movie begins playing. \n\nIn the movie you see yourself walking around a big city, and then sitting down in front of a computer. You notice that you are able to control what happens in the movie, and you start manipulating things for your own amusement. You make yourself send random e-mails to people you know in this new life. It's innocent enough. The others don't seem to have the same control. They don't notice that you can do this. \n\nYou make him then start googling how to bring a former reincarnation of you back to life.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 5,
  "reference_text": " He sees that a therapist may be able to help. You send him to the therapist. The therapist does a hypnosis session, and the former you remembers everything. They are overwhelmed but you keep them under control. You have them ask to bring back you specifically. They are told it is possible, but difficult.",
